data: {"id": "3fb44f5767c7479e-thinking-parallel_evidence-1161", "run_id": "3fb44f5767c7479e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 首轮证据采集结果\n\n### 1. Pod 生命周期与调度状态\n**事实支持 PendingUnschedulable：**\n- `kubectl_get_by_name` 返回 STATUS=Pending, NODE=<none>, READY=0/1，持续 24 分钟。\n- `kubectl_describe` 事件（核心证据）：\n  - `FailedScheduling` 在 24 分钟前触发：**\"0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector\"**\n  - `FailedScheduling` 在 14 分钟前再次触发（x2 over 19 分钟），原因相同。\n- Pod 的 **Node-Selector 为 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true`**（来自 describe）。\n- 集群共有 3 个节点：master、node1、node2。\n\n### 2. 节点标签验证\n**事实证实根因：**\n- `kubernetes_jq_query`", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 7, "ts_ms": 1788761814438, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

