data: {"id": "3fb44f5767c7479e-thinking-parallel_evidence-1848", "run_id": "3fb44f5767c7479e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "结果如预期：Pod 未运行（node: <none>），所以没有 CPU 使用指标返回，`coverage: empty` 是有效的数据边界。\n\n## 已采集事实总结\n\n### 支持候选原因的证据（PendingUnschedulable）\n\n**核心证据：NodeSelector 不匹配**\n\n从 `kubectl_describe` 结果：\n- **Pod 状态**: Pending，`node: <none>`\n- **调度失败原因**: `0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector`\n- **根本原因**: Pod 设置了 `Node-Selectors: aiops.lab/unavailable=true`，集群中没有节点匹配此标签\n\n这意味着：\n1. 不是资源不足（CPU 5m, Memory 8Mi 是非常小的请求）\n2. 不是 Taint/Toleration 问题（Pod 只有 `not-ready` 的 toleration）\n3. 纯粹的 label s", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788761828379, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "3fb44f5767c7479e-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "3fb44f5767c7479e", "seq": 1849, "ts_ms": 1788761838481, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 63.343, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-01", "name": "workload-68c557d875-bsq52"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/3fb44f5767c7479e-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "ab73ec5b6dfb7a380224ad81efb77ac99bd463f6c3c22d51daf9a3a1f49a1643", "bytes": 2633}, "snapshot_sha256": "c19c24bf8d3eebfcd231a46dadca67fa99f8b9b5701b892a903d17d2707844e9"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "3fb44f5767c7479e-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "3fb44f5767c7479e", "seq": 1850, "ts_ms": 1788761838481, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "3fb44f5767c7479e-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "3fb44f5767c7479e", "seq": 1851, "ts_ms": 1788761845241, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 6.76, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1199, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52 处于 Pending 状态且持续 24 分钟未能调度到任何节点。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `kubernetes` (fact-06c321aec3a6) | `FailedScheduling: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector.` | 直接确认 Pod 因亲和性/选择器不匹配被拒绝调度。 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | `kubernetes` (fact-1a7d138899c4) | `container.app.cpu.request: 5m` | 排除 CPU 资源不足导致的调度失败。 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | `kubernetes` (fact-465a569df863) | `container.app.memory.request: 8Mi` | 排除内存资源不足导致的调度失败。 |\n| 4 | Metric | `prometheus` (fact-690befd25fd5) | `kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"} = 1` | 确认 Pod 当前处于 Pending 状态的客观事实。 |\n\n**证据总结：**\nPod 因 NodeSelector 不匹配被 K8s 调度器拒绝，但容器配置的 CPU (5m) 和内存 (8Mi) 请求量极低，集群资源瓶颈被排除。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置 NodeSelector (aiops.lab/unavailable=true) → 集群节点未匹配该选择器 → 调度器触发 FailedScheduling → Pod 持续 Pending\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\nPod `workload-68c557d875-bsq52` 配置了 `NodeSelector: aiops.lab/unavailable=true`，但集群中不存在携带该标签的节点（#1）。由于 CPU 和内存请求量极低（#2, #3），该调度失败纯粹由标签匹配策略与节点状态不一致导致。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52 处于 Pending 状态且持续 24 分钟未能调度到任何节点。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `kubernetes` (fact-06c321aec3a6) | `FailedScheduling: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector.` | 直接确认 Pod 因亲和性/选择器不匹配被拒绝调度。 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | `kubernetes` (fact-1a7d138899c4) | `container.app.cpu.request: 5m` | 排除 CPU 资源不足导致的调度失败。 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | `kubernetes` (fact-465a569df863) | `container.app.memory.request: 8Mi` | 排除内存资源不足导致的调度失败。 |\n| 4 | Metric | `prometheus` (fact-690befd25fd5) | `kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"} = 1` | 确认 Pod 当前处于 Pending 状态的客观事实。 |\n\n**证据总结：**\nPod 因 NodeSelector 不匹配被 K8s 调度器拒绝，但容器配置的 CPU (5m) 和内存 (8Mi) 请求量极低，集群资源瓶颈被排除。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置 NodeSelector (aiops.lab/unavailable=true) → 集群节点未匹配该选择器 → 调度器触发 FailedScheduling → Pod 持续 Pending\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\nPod `workload-68c557d875-bsq52` 配置了 `NodeSelector: aiops.lab/unavailable=true`，但集群中不存在携带该标签的节点（#1）。由于 CPU 和内存请求量极低（#2, #3），该调度失败纯粹由标签匹配策略与节点状态不一致导致。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

